  "review_notes": [
    "Manufacturer emsgroup.co.uk returned HTTP 503 for seven product/PDF requests and subsequent browser checks. No failed EMS URL is used as a downloadable reference.",
    "Eight mirror PDFs were downloaded successfully with HTTP 200 and inspected for the EMS branding, document code, revision, actual product codes and manufacturer figure. Titles and card text come from those documents, not reseller compatibility assertions.",
    "No associations to unrelated SmartCell or FirePoint panel records were added.",
    "Older FC-610-001 I/O is kept distinct from FC-41-0202. RCC and Hub source figures carry V3 badges; the cards retain the exact unsuffixed codes actually printed in their 2018 sheets, without inventing a V3 ordering suffix or conflating alternate-power variants.",
    "Combined sounder/detector card identifies FCX-191-000 base only; manufacturer photo includes a fitted head. Optical and wall-VAD head-only codes similarly disclose the pictured separate base.",
    "Securitysuppliers.ie source returned HTTP 403; it was not retried or used. Acorn was excluded. WDC deferred because this bounded batch already includes eight verified functional families."
  ],
  "visual_review": "Each final card image was inspected on the per-brand contact sheet and compared with its source product page or manufacturer PDF illustration. Shared housing, assembled-head/base and edition limitations were retained."
}
